BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:paxos-gaios-velianitatika-litany-of-panagia-vellianiton-sunday-of--2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270523
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270524
SUMMARY:Litany of Panagia Vellianiton\, Sunday of the Paralytic\, Gaios
LOCATION:Gaios (Velianitatika)\, Paxos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the fourth Sunday after Easter the ancient icon of the Dormition is carried from Agios Georgios in Velianitatika through the olive groves\, chapels and lanes of Gaios to the islet monastery\, with the Metropolitan of Corfu\, the schools and the philharmonic\, and blessings at decorated stops along the way\; broth and meat are again served under the pergolas at the monastery gate. Falls in May\, a lovely time on Paxos\; the whole thing starts after the 9:30am liturgy.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paxos/#gaios-velianitatika-litany-of-panagia-vellianiton-sunday-of-
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paxos/#gaios-velianitatika-litany-of-panagia-vellianiton-sunday-of-
END:VEVENT
