BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:paxos-gaios-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-gaios-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270628
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270630
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agioi Apostoloi\, Gaios
LOCATION:Gaios\, Paxos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Corfu-region festival calendars list Gaios among the places keeping Peter and Paul on 29 June\, with vespers on the 28th and a village evening with music and food on the square\; Paxos also joins Corfu in the Panagia Vlachernon celebrations on 2 July. Small and local\; ask at the port kiosk which square the music is in.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paxos/#gaios-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-gaios
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/paxos/#gaios-panigiri-of-agioi-apostoloi-gaios
END:VEVENT
